{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q1069926","formula":"Fe(SO₄)·5H₂O","hill":"FeH10O9S","elements":["H","O","S","Fe"],"composition":{"H":10.0,"O":9.0,"S":1.0,"Fe":1.0},"names":{"en":"Siderotil","uk":"Сидеротил"},"descriptions":{"en":"Siderotil is an iron(II) sulfate hydrate mineral with formula: FeSO4·5H2O which forms by the dehydration of melanterite. Copper commonly occurs substituting for iron in the structure. It typically occurs as fibrous or powdery encrustations, but may also occur as acicular triclinic crystals.","uk":"Сидеротил — гідратний мінерал, сульфат заліза(II) з формулою: FeSO 4 ⋅ 5 H 2 O {\\displaystyle {\\ce {FeSO4*5H2O}}} , який утворюється в результаті дегідратації мелантериту. Мідь зазвичай заміщує залізо в структурі. Зазвичай сидеротил трапляється у вигляді волокнистих або порошкоподібних інкрустацій, але також може траплятися у вигляді голчастих триклінніх кристалів."},"fame":13,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1069926","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siderotil","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B8%D0%B4%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B8%D0%BB","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Siderotil.jpg","license":"CC BY 4.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q3942089","formula":"FeSO₄*4H₂O","names":{"en":"Rozenite","uk":"Розеніт"},"elements":["H","O","S","Fe"],"fame":11,"kind":"crystal"},{"id":"Q3676119","formula":"Mn(SO₄)(H₂O)₆","names":{"en":"Chvaleticeite"},"elements":["H","O","S","Mn"],"fame":7,"kind":null},{"id":"Q3743240","formula":"Fe(SO₄